
                       geant4-11-04-ref-09
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Migrated G4tools headers/includes to use .hh extension for clarity and
   discoverability.
 o In G4LogicalVolume, refined the storage of key attributes which are
   constant during simulation for specific volumes types, i.e. logical
   volumes used only in placement and replicas physical volumes. Logical
   volumes used by "varying" physical volumes (parameterised, divisions,
   replicated slices) are marked as "mutable" and maintain a per-thread
   instance of the attributes.
 o Accelerated G4MultiUnion accurate DistanceToIn(p) safety with a component
   bounding-box hierarchy. Accelerated faceted twisted solids queries.
 o Sanity check and fixes in G4Tubs, G4Cons, G4CutTubs, G4Sphere and G4Torus,
   as well as in G4Hype, G4Paraboloid, and G4EllipticalTube.
 o Improved G4Para directional distance queries and G4Polycone/G4Polyhedra,
   G4ExtrudedSolid and G4TessellatedSolid scaling.
 o Refactored ScanAndSetCouple() in G4ProductionCutsTable to avoid re-visiting
   shared logical volumes reachable via multiple paths in the volume hierarchy.
 o Updated to GIDI+ 3.35.0-3. Added a thick-target Bremsstrahlung model.

